    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages the enabling and disabling of subtarget specific features. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Features are encoded as a string of the form &quot;+attr1,+attr2,-attr3,...,+attrN&quot; A comma separates each feature from the next (all lowercase.) Each of the remaining features is prefixed with + or - indicating whether that feature should be enabled or disabled contrary to the cpu specification. </para>
